## valid feedback is stored: PUT /docs/_api/v1/page-feedback/{{$guid}}
status: 204 No Content

## a thumbs down needs a reason: PUT /docs/_api/v1/page-feedback/{{$guid}}
status: 400 Bad Request
content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "errorType": "invalid_arguments",
  "message": "The page feedback is invalid. Check pageUrl, pageTitle, reaction, reasons and comment."
}

## feedback is deleted: DELETE /docs/_api/v1/page-feedback/{{$guid}}
status: 204 No Content
